    "The full4416 run also revealed set-stage23-constructor-listing-default mismatch; preserve the actual raw status and type-default investigation, with no regression-free claim.",
    "Finite committed Stage63/62 duplicate recovery05 was terminal and reclaimed about 1.63 GiB; it did not meet a 3 GiB free-space target and did not run compatibility guests.",
    "Six late scalar nonpasses in full4416 are historical Stage47/48 mismatches (Int32 narrowing\u00d72, unpaired URI\u00d71, malformed HTTP\u00d73), not newly introduced regressions; raw statuses remain nonpasses.",
    "Recovery06 exhausted the finite Stage61/60 duplicate scope after reclaiming about 821 MiB; its additional 1.5 GiB aim was not met, although measured total free rose above 3 GiB."
